title: "Àkàndé: Self-Hosted Provider-Agnostic Voice Assistant"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted, provider-agnostic voice assistant that delivers structured
  executive briefings via voice or text across 10 LLM providers with
  EU AI Act Article 50 transparency controls and AudioSeal watermarking.
